s=\"lex-cite-scope\">326</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> poet., the <b class=\"lex-tr\">origin</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">source</b> of events, <span class=\"gk\">μ. ἀέθλων</span>, of Olympia, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πειθαρχία γὰρ τῆς εὐπραξίας μ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">225</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ γνώμη κακῶν μ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1361</span> </span>; of night, as <b class=\"lex-tr\">the mother</b> of day, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">265</span> </span>; the grape of wine, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">614</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">757</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ματέρ' οἰνάνθας ὀπώραν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.6</span> </span>; Aphrodite of the Loves, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">122.4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φάτις ὦ μᾶτερ αἰσχύνας ἐμᾶς</span>, of a rumour, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"le